ction style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">google/gemma-4-31B-it</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Gemma-4-31B-it 是 Google 推出的开源指令微调大语言模型。该模型拥有 310 亿参数，在逻辑推理、代码生成及多轮对话方面表现出色。其定位为兼顾性能与效率的平衡型模型，适用于复杂任务处理、学术研究及开发者构建定制化的智能助手，能够在本地或私有云环境中高效部署，满足中大规模参数下的高质量生成需求。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#2 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-04-05/02-jackrong-qwen3-5-27b-claude-4-6-opus-reasoning-distilled.png\" alt=\"Jackrong/Qwen3.5-27B-Claude-4.6-Opus-Reasoning-Distilled\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">Jackrong/Qwen3.5-27B-Claude-4.6-Opus-Reasoning-Distilled</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qwen3.5-27B-Claude-4.6-Opus-Reasoning-Distilled 是基于 Qwen3.5 架构进行微调的蒸馏模型。通过学习 Claude 3.5 Opus 的推理模式，该模型显著增强了深度思维与逻辑推理能力。它适合处理复杂的逻辑分析、数学计算及多步推理任务。作者提供了完整的训练代码与指南，方便开发者研究模型微调技术并将其应用于特定领域任务。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-04-05/03-coherelabs-cohere-transcribe-03-2026.png\" alt=\"CohereLabs/cohere-transcribe-03-2026\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">CohereLabs/cohere-transcribe-03-2026</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Cohere-Transcribe-03-2026 是 Cohere Labs 开源的一款 20 亿参数专用自动语音识别（ASR）模型。该模型采用音频输入、文本输出架构，支持全球 14 种主流语言。其设计精简高效，旨在提供高准确率的语音转文字服务，非常适合构建会议纪要整理、语音输入法、多语言实时翻译等对延迟与资源消耗有要求的应用场景。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-04-05/04-baidu-qianfan-ocr.png\" alt=\"baidu/Qianfan-OCR\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">baidu/Qianfan-OCR</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qianfan-OCR 是百度推出的统一端到端文档智能模型。该模型专注于复杂的文档图像处理与文字识别任务，能够高效解析多样化的文档格式，并实现高精度的信息提取。它在处理财务报表、合同分析及票据识别等垂直行业场景中表现出众，旨在为企业用户提供自动化、智能化的数据录入与文档数字化解决方案。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-04-05/05-prism-ml-bonsai-8b-gguf.png\" alt=\"prism-ml/Bonsai-8B-gguf\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">prism-ml/Bonsai-8B-gguf</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Bonsai-8B-gguf 是针对消费级硬件优化的 80 亿参数轻量化语言模型，以 GGUF 格式封装。该模型定位为高效能、低资源占用的本地运行方案，特别适合在个人电脑或边缘计算设备上快速部署使用。凭借其精巧的架构，它能够提供响应迅速的基础语言理解与生成服务，非常适合个人助手、本地文档助手或离线应用开发。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qHfXxy1pes1eXWicJWxHTLGxL323Gh029A2JkOLQP3EibEUYlkLeB2vgvuhnUoyqoPg1etjxySFodeOgR45dHqS2s2kZ8KyjA65MCPMPbBBGo/0?wx_fmt=gif\" alt=\"底部引导\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\" /></section></section>",
